{
  "id": "ss.base.cairn",
  "name": "Salt cairn",
  "description": "Three slabs of the pan's salt plate stacked by the north-west road, drawn the way the pan's own plates are (`ss.terrain.saltplate`), salt crusted white along their edges and cracked, a chip fallen at the foot, with a stake bound into them and a frayed strip of cold cloth flapping on it (`flutter`), cut into lengths so a wave can run out along it to its tails. In feelers this is the way out to the Salt Pan.",
  "tags": ["base"],
  "size": [32, 52],
